otect ourselves as much as  possible from inflation or we can do  nothing and remain a part of the middle  class that constantly just keeps getting  poorer and poorer to me the choice is  clear but that's just what i think would  you guys prefer zero inflation comment  that down below also drop a like if you  hope that inflation cools down sooner  rather than later and of course consider  joining our discord community to suggest  for your video ideas and consider  subscribing see more questions that  logically answered but until then i'm  hari i'll see you guys on the next one

